        "raw_output": "{\n  \"slots\": [\n    {\n      \"variable\": \"current_feelings\",\n      \"observations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cf1\",\n          \"stance\": \"support\",\n          \"value\": \"The user currently feels that the joy they once found in sharing their perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that their passion for music needs to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which they are finally starting to embrace. They have also realized that their original excitement for sharing experiences was overshadowed by the demanding nature of content creation, and they are now contemplating other avenues to express their love for music in a manner that feels authentic and fulfilling rather than burdensome. They have found fulfillment in organizing a festival highlighting Pacific Islander artists, which has been a positive and rewarding experience, but their feelings about music review writing remain negative due to past pressures and the fear of public scrutiny.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s22\", \"s23\", \"s24\", \"s32\", \"s33\", \"s34\", \"s35\", \"s36\", \"s39\", \"s40\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"current\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user's own statements in s3 and s4 directly describe the fear of backlash and the decision to express passion in a more personal, less public way. In s22, s23, and s24, they describe how podcasting became a chore and led them to rethink how to share their music journey, seeking authentic and fulfilling avenues. In s32–s36, they describe the successful and rewarding festival experience, which is a current positive outlet. In s39 and s40, the assistant asks if their feelings about music reviews have changed, and the user does not indicate any positive change; the context of the conversation (s3, s4) shows the negative feelings persist. Together, these sources support the current feelings and attitudes as summarized.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}",
