her options either misinterpret the user's journey (a, b, d) or suggest a confidence or community focus that is not supported by the evidence.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"audit_verdict\": \"supported\",\n  \"final_prediction\": \"c\",\n  \"semantic_answer\": \"It's understandable that the weight of public scrutiny can diminish the joy of sharing your thoughts on music. You've gone through significant changes in how you perceive album reviews, especially given your previous experience of feeling overwhelmed by criticism. It seems this latest realization has reinforced that need for a more personal expression of your passion. Embracing this new approach to sharing your music connects back to your past reflections on the pressure of public opinion. Your journey highlights the importance of staying true to your emotional connection with the art you love.\"\n}",
